# Benchmark/run scratch output (logs, per-run JSON) — not project state
scratchpad/

# Pipeline results belong to the card-authoring worktree, never to this tree.
# engine/card_effects/json holds CARDS. When .drafts/, .review/, .triage/ and
# .draft-review/ were also kept there, every corpus sweep and every test that
# located a card by rglob picked up a review verdict filed under the same slug
# -- 77 tests failed for reasons unrelated to the cards they named, and ~48
# test files carried the same latent bug. Keep them out of this repo entirely.
engine/card_effects/json/.drafts/
engine/card_effects/json/.review/
engine/card_effects/json/.triage/
engine/card_effects/json/.draft-review/
engine/card_effects/json/.draft-notes/
engine/card_effects/json/.modelbench/
engine/card_effects/queues/
engine/card_effects/json/review_queue.json
engine/card_effects/json/triage_queue.json
.bench/

# Derived from FAB_Coach/fab_games.db, rebuilt by
# scripts/verify_card_against_talishar.py --refresh-index
card_data/talishar_card_index.json

# Generated by scripts/generate_talishar_states.py against the local
